---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ClosingBand from "../components/ClosingBand.astro";
import FramedPhoto from "../components/FramedPhoto.astro";
import photos from "../data/photos.json";
import imgCity from "../assets/photos/about-city.jpg";
---

<Base
  title="About Green Africa"
  description="Who we are, where we operate, and why the business is deliberately narrow."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About"
    headline="We're building the boring layer."
    subhead="Green Africa builds the plumbing that everything above it has to be able to rely on."
  />

  <!-- Why we exist -->
  <section class="rule-t">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-10 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow text-leaf">01 — Why we exist</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
          Unprovable work doesn't attract capital.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/75 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <p>
          Plastic recovery in Nigeria has never suffered from a shortage of effort. What that effort
          lacks is any way to prove it happened.
        </p>
        <p>
          A brand can't fund what it can't report, and a credit market can't price what it can't
          verify. Funders hit the same wall from the other side, with nothing to audit. Meanwhile
          the collector at the bottom of the chain, who is doing the actual environmental work,
          captures the smallest share of the value, because they hold the material and not the
          evidence.
        </p>
        <p class="font-medium text-ink">We decided to build the evidence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we chose not to build -->
  <section class="rule-t">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-10 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow text-leaf">02 — What we chose not to build</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
          A deliberately narrow business.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/75 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <p>
          We are not trying to become Nigeria's largest aggregator, and we have no plans to build
          pelletising capacity or import machines.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each of those is a capital-heavy business, and in each case somebody is already better at
          it than we are. What we do instead is narrow and asset-light: verify the material where it
          is recovered, and make sure the value of that proof reaches the people who earned it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Recognition -->
  <section class="bg-pine text-paper">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-10 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow text-leaf-bright">03 — Recognition</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
          First place overall, 2025 Hedera Africa Hackathon.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/75 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <p>
          Green Africa won first place overall and the cross-track championship at the 2025 Hedera
          Africa Hackathon, competing against more than 1,300 submissions from over 13,000
          developers. That prize is funding the deployment now in progress.
        </p>
        <p>
          It is a real cheque and useful validation. What makes it a business is the machines going
          into the ground.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Where we are -->
  <section class="bg-sand/60">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-10 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow text-leaf">04 — Where we are</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
          Based in Ibadan, working across Lagos and Oyo.
        </h2>
        <FramedPhoto
          src={imgCity}
          alt={photos["about-city"].alt}
          credit={`Photo: ${photos["about-city"].photographer} / Pexels`}
          class="mt-8"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/75 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <p>
          Founded and operating in Nigeria, with offices in Ibadan and operations across Lagos and
          Oyo States. The hardware is fabricated here, and the team that builds and services it
          lives here.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ClosingBand
    headline="Come and see one."
    body="The best version of this conversation happens standing in front of a machine. If you're in Lagos or Ibadan, we'll show you."
  />
</Base>
